## D365 Shared Knowledge

This project uses shared D365 F&O knowledge from the `d365` template.

**When you learn something transferable about D365 F&O:**
1. Update `semantic/` or `procedural/` in this project
2. Use `engram sync . ~/.engram/pools/d365` to push back to the shared pool
3. Keep project-specific details out — use placeholders like `<COMPANY>`, `<ENTITY>`
